      "Will you…? también sirve para pedir un favor: Will you help me? = ¿Me ayudas?",
      "Con going to: BE va primero. Are you going to come? Is she going to cook? Respuesta corta: Yes, I am. / No, I'm not. Yes, she is. / No, she isn't.",
